      "comment": "The guideline mandates a minimum non-driving period of six weeks following a severe hypoglycaemic event. The patient's episode occurred after skipping lunch last week."
    },
    {
      "source_slot": 1,
      "patient_paragraph": 2,
      "applicability": "established",
      "finding": "conditional_qualified",
      "comment": "The guideline requires the specialist's assessment to confirm the severity of the event. The patient denies passing out and there is no contemporaneous clinical assessment confirming the severity."
    },
    {
      "source_slot": 2,
